OL,3,GNEWSAThe '50s Slough estate that felt
OL,4,Alike 'paradise'
OL,5,
OL,6,F70 years on, Collman will be
OL,7,Fcelebrating the rich history of the
OL,8,FBerkshire town's housing estate at the
OL,9,Fweekend, sharing old memories and
OL,10,Fcreating new ones with residents both
OL,11,Fyoung and old.
